00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:27.536
<v Host>It means shipment — sending products from the farm to the stores.

00:02:28.135 --> 00:02:40.424
<v Slow>シャインマスカットは、緑色の大きいぶどうです。種がなくて、皮のまま食べることができます。

00:02:41.223 --> 00:02:47.415
<v Host>Shine Muscat is a big green grape. It has no seeds, and you can eat it with the skin on.

00:02:48.015 --> 00:02:49.984
<v Vocab>皮

00:02:50.383 --> 00:02:54.704
<v Host>It means skin, or peel — the outside part of a fruit.

00:02:55.304 --> 00:03:03.848
<v Slow>今年の夏はとても暑かったので、実はいつもより甘くなりました。

00:03:04.647 --> 00:03:09.759
<v Host>Because this summer was very hot, the fruit became sweeter than usual.

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.448
