00:03:12.848 --> 00:03:16.063
<v Host>It means sweet — like sugar or ripe fruit.

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:22.663
<v Slow>そして、値段は去年より安くなっています。

00:03:23.463 --> 00:03:26.175
<v Host>And the price is lower than last year.

00:03:26.776 --> 00:03:28.864
<v Vocab>値段

00:03:29.264 --> 00:03:32.383
<v Host>It means price — how much something costs.

00:03:32.984 --> 00:03:43.400
<v Slow>理由は、シャインマスカットを作る農家が増えて、たくさんの実が店に並んでいるからです。

00:03:44.199 --> 00:03:50.127
<v Host>The reason is that more farmers now grow these grapes, so many of them line the shop shelves.

00:03:50.728 --> 00:03:52.912
<v Vocab>農家

00:03:53.312 --> 00:03:56.312
<v Host>It means farmer, or a farming family.

00:03:56.912 --> 00:04:10.759
<v Slow>シャインマスカットは、今、日本で一番多く作られているぶどうです。人気は、海外にも広がっています。

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:19.456
<v Host>Shine Muscat is now the most widely grown grape in Japan, and its popularity is spreading overseas, too.

