00:04:27.439 --> 00:04:38.576
<v Slow>大阪府羽曳野市の直売所では、大きい実のシャインマスカットが、棚にいっぱい並んでいます。

00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:45.903
<v Host>At a farm stand in Habikino City, Osaka, big Shine Muscat grapes fill the shelves.

00:04:46.504 --> 00:04:48.687
<v Vocab>並ぶ

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:52.903
<v Host>It means to line up — to stand or be placed in a row.

00:04:53.504 --> 00:05:00.872
<v Slow>シャインマスカットの出荷は、9月の終わりごろまで続きます。

00:05:01.672 --> 00:05:05.439
<v Host>Shipments will continue until around the end of September.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.295
