<v Slow>シャインマスカットの出荷は、いつごろまで続きますか。

00:07:30.384 --> 00:07:32.879
<v Host>Until around the end of September.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:45.720
<v Host>That's all for today. Sweet, seedless, and easier on the wallet this year — if you visit Japan this month, a bunch of Shine Muscat is a perfect taste of autumn. See you next time!

00:07:46.319 --> 00:07:48.720
